    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoTableGridLight\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: none;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 517.5pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 450.8pt; border: solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 517.5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"601\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Pathognomonic criteria</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Adult Lhermitte&ndash;Duclos disease (cerebellar tumours)</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Mucocutaneous lesions</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 72.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\">-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Facial trichilemmomas, any number<sup>a</sup> (&ge;&nbsp;2&nbsp;biopsy-proven trichilemmomas<sup>b</sup>)</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 72.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\">-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Acral keratoses</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 72.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\">-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Papillomatous papules</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Mucosal lesions</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Autism spectrum disorder</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Major criteria</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Breast cancer</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Non-medullary thyroid cancer</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Megalocephaly</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Endometrial carcinoma</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Mucocutaneous lesions<sup>b</sup></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 72.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\">-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1&nbsp;biopsy-proven trichilemmoma</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 72.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\">-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Multiple palmoplantar keratoses</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 72.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\">-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Multifocal cutaneous facial papules</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 72.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\">-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Macular pigmentation of the glans penis</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Multiple gastrointestinal hamartomas or ganglioneuromas<sup>b</sup></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Minor criteria</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Other thyroid lesions (follicular adenomas, multinodular goitre)</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Mental retardation (i.e. IQ of &le;&nbsp;75)</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Gastrointestinal hamartomas<sup>a</sup> (single gastrointestinal hamartoma or ganglioneuroma<sup>b</sup>)</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Fibrocystic breast disease</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Lipomas</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Fibromas</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Genitourinary tumours (especially renal cell carcinoma)</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Genitourinary malformations<sup>a</sup></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Uterine fibroids</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Autism spectrum disorder<sup>b</sup></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Relaxed ICC operational diagnostic criteria for Cowden syndrome</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 15.65pt;\">&ge;&nbsp;1&nbsp;pathognomonic criterion</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.9pt;\"><em>or</em></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 15.65pt;\">&ge;&nbsp;2 major or minor criteria<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><sup>a</sup>Present in this section as defined by ICC criteria only. <sup>b</sup>Present in this section as defined by National Comprehensive Cancer Network (NCCN) 2010 criteria only.</p>",
